data: {"id": "8297c09aa26a44d5-thinking-layer-418", "run_id": "8297c09aa26a44d5", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "当前集群存在 1 个异常 Pod：\n\n### 异常定位\n- **异常 Pod**: `aiops-case-v02/workload`\n- **当前状态**: `Pending` (0/1 Ready)\n- **异常类型**: `PendingUnschedulable` (调度失败)\n- **异常组**: `group-pending-scheduling` (仅包含该 Pod)\n\n### 状态详情\n该 Pod 处于 `Pending` 状态且未绑定到任何节点 (`NODE: <none>`)。根据 `pod-pending-unschedulable.md` 手册，这通常由调度器无法找到满足调度约束（资源、亲和性、Taint/Toleration、PVC 绑定等）的节点引起。\n\n### 关键实体\n- Pod: `aiops-case-v02/workload`\n\n### 可能场景\n1. 集群节点资源（CPU/Memory/Ephemeral-Storage）不足。\n2. Pod 的调度约束（nodeSelector/affinity/tolerations）与现有节点不匹配。\n3.", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788860512414}

