data: {"id": "8297c09aa26a44d5-final", "run_id": "8297c09aa26a44d5", "seq": 953, "ts_ms": 1788860548772, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v02/workload` | Pending | Pod workload in aiops-case-v02 namespace is stuck in Pending state |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedScheduling` (Warning): `0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory.` | 明确调度失败原因，集群节点内存不足 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | 容器 `app` 内存请求值 (request) = `1Pi` | 提供导致资源不足的异常配置源头 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes | 容器 `app` 内存限制值 (limit) = `1Pi`；CPU 请求=5m，限制=50m | 辅助确认资源定义的异常性（单位极大，不符合常规集群规模） |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod 状态 = `Pending` | 确认当前系统状态为调度挂起 |\n\n**证据关联说明**：\nKubernetes 配置事实（#2, #3）展示了异常的资源请求规模（1Pi），这直接导致了 #1 中调度器报出“3 Insufficient memory”的 `FailedScheduling` 事件，最终表现为 #4 的 `Pending` 状态。由于容器未启动，Metrics、Logging 和 Tracing 维度均处于 `not_applicable` 状态，无其他维度事实。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n异常资源定义 (请求 1Pi 内存) → 调度器资源校验失败 (集群 3 节点均无法满足) → 触发 FailedScheduling 事件 → Pod 卡在 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：集群内存资源不足。\n具体为 Pod `aiops-case-v02/workload` 的容器 `app` 请求了 **1Pi (Petabyte)** 的内存资源（证据编号 #2），该请求量远超集群中所有 3 个节点的可用内存总和，导致默认调度器（default-scheduler）在尝试分配时因资源不足（Insufficient memory）且无可抢占对象而宣告失败（证据编号 #1），致使 Pod 无法进入运行状态。\n\n该根因基于 Kubernetes 控制面的原始事件日志和资源配置事实，证据链完整。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 44.8s\n├─ 问题定位: 18.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 19.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v02/workload: 19.2s (Evidence 14.2s, RCA 4.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v02/workload**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 44.802, "metrics": {"run_id": "8297c09aa26a44d5", "mttr": {"value": "44.8s", "seconds": 44.808878660202026, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 44808.87866020203, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 42108.87360572815, "tool_calls": 7, "executed_tool_calls": 7, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 7, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 6462.0630741119385, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2488.3522987365723}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 18330.647706985474, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 19157.974004745483, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 7300.082445144653, "success": true}}, "success":